WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Auntie, you are so confused, why did you buy it for her dog?

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:07,700
This dog is probably a skewer, at most a country dog with some genes from a breed dog.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,180
Just buy a Xiangchuan bag for 9.9 yuan!

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:17,640
Haha, according to your opinion, I shouldn’t buy it for Yoyo’s dog, so who should I buy it for? For you?

5
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:23,280
Aunt, since you are so kind and difficult to leave, then I feel it is unfair. Please wrap it up for me and swipe my aunt's card.

6
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:26,080
Okay, okay, Miss Su, I'll pack it for you right away.

7
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:26,691
Wrong

8
00:00:26,691 --> 00:00:27,182
madam

9
00:00:27,182 --> 00:00:28,656
You swipe the card first

10
00:00:28,656 --> 00:00:31,603
Witness once again the diversity of humankind

11
00:00:31,603 --> 00:00:34,550
Who said the master is in the British Museum?

12
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:37,470
Isn’t this right here? Are there two more?

13
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:40,390
Can't they hear that Mrs. Ying is acting strangely?

14
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:45,550
Swipe, why don't you swipe your card? Could you please stop being possessive of other people's money?

15
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:46,785
I like yoyo

16
00:00:46,785 --> 00:00:47,773
Love is endless

17
00:00:47,773 --> 00:00:49,995
Of course I also like Yoyo’s dog

18
00:00:49,995 --> 00:00:51,230
I can send it if I want

19
00:00:51,230 --> 00:00:53,700
What does this have to do with you?

20
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,830
You are playing tricks on me, you dare to play tricks on me?

21
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:59,320
As for the cooperative project, I think it’s better to cancel it.

22
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,720
Auntie, I'm kidding you, hahaha.

23
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:06,740
Sister, do you love being slapped in the face so much because you are thick-skinned? Doesn’t it hurt when you get hit?
